  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2604.01 Exception Permits. Exception permits shall be granted for fireworks that shall be used for agricultural, railroad or military purposes only.\n\nSource. #5752, eff 12-2-93; ss by INTERIM #7140, eff 12-2-99, EXPIRED: 3-31-00\n\nNew. #7905, eff 6-24-03; ss by #8519, eff 12-16-05; ss by #10784, eff 2-13-15",
